            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:30:32.894324+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-luna-low-r1-b19",
            "text": "The estranged couple transferred funds into these accounts from their own personal accounts.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:30:32.894324+00:00"
          },
          {
